     ],
     "page_section_element_body": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "A design template is a file with an overall layout and format to be used for a group of documents. With a template, the layout has already been designed with placeholder text and images to be replaced with information relevant to you. A design template defines the colour scheme, font style, and format. When using templates, please pay attention to the grid, alignment, and consistency of document language with logo language.\n",
       "spans": [],
       "direction": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "Note that most templates are only downloadable by Aalto personnel from the material bank. All Aalto personnel should log into the material bank with HAKA login.",
       "spans": [
        {
         "start": 0,
         "end": 4,
         "type": "strong"
